Font,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达升级Isaac机器人平台并发布Agile ONE SN人形样机</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">科大讯飞发布讯飞星火 X2.6端云一体大模型，实现全国产算力训练突破</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 向所有客户开放 Decisions API，决策延迟最低降至100毫秒级</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌云正式开放Anthropic Claude托管部署选项，支持企业首发日接入</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85eb6c6bbc382b1bfb36920bfc16cbce.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌云于10月23日正式上线Anthropic托管的Claude模型部署选项，允许企业直接在谷歌云基础设施上运行Claude模型，并确保在模型发布当日即可使用最新版本。该方案通过分工协作，模型能力由Anthropic提供，而身份与访问管理（IAM）、审计日志及云账单体系等基础设施控制权仍由企业通过谷歌云平台掌控。此外，谷歌云保留了原有的全程托管部署方案，支持虚拟私有云服务控制、客户管理加密密钥以及覆盖美国、欧盟和亚太地区的数据驻留能力。企业可根据合规性与控制权需求，在Anthropic托管与谷歌云全程托管两种路径中灵活选择。此举旨在降低企业数据迁移成本，提升模型接入效率，为企业用户提供更具灵活性的AI部署方案。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌云将部署96万块Rubin GPU并发布基于Vera Rubin的A5X实例</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/46362050c23029964e86795c43d89b14.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌云宣布将基于英伟达Vera Rubin平台扩展基础设施，计划在多个算力站点部署最多96万块Rubin GPU。同步发布的A5X实例基于英伟达Vera Rubin NVL72机架级系统，搭载ConnectX-9 SuperNIC，并集成谷歌云Virgo网络与第四代液冷技术，预计下月正式推出。在安全领域，谷歌云将成为首批在裸机实例上提供机架级英伟达机密计算服务的云厂商，同时在搭载RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell服务器版GPU的G4虚拟机上推出该服务。通过机密计算，谷歌云实现了数据在处理过程中的加密隔离，旨在满足金融、医疗及政务等敏感行业对数据安全的需求。此次大规模算力扩容与安全能力升级，标志着谷歌云在应对大模型高密度长周期负载方面进一步强化了基础设施底座，通过自研TPU与英伟达GPU的双轨策略，持续</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达升级Isaac机器人平台并发布Agile ONE SN人形样机</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a15f2b30e9e5f4fba97b97a6a3905c29.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达近日升级NVIDIA Isaac开源机器人平台，推出全新人形机器人参考样机、配套数据集及运行时，并全面升级机器人学习框架。思灵机器人同步发布全栈人形样机Agile ONE SN，该机预装NVIDIA Isaac GR00T，搭载NVIDIA Jetson Thor边缘AI平台。Agile ONE SN身高1.4米，重40千克，具备31个自由度及20自由度的WUJI Hand2灵巧手，板载算力达2070TFLOPS，配备128GB统一内存，预计2027年初上市。此次升级构建了从数据采集到部署的一体化工具链：SimReady资源库新增超2000个仿真资产，Human1M数据集引入动作与三维手部追踪数据，NVIDIA Isaac Lab 3.0支持多GPU并行工作流，NVIDIA Isaac OS与安全平台NV</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">科大讯飞发布讯飞星火 X2.6端云一体大模型，实现全国产算力训练突破</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/19e778745a7f693229bb383699cf7a05.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">科大讯飞正式发布讯飞星火 X2.6端云一体大模型，成为业内首个基于全国产算力训练并突破代码与智能体能力的大模型。该模型采用293B-A30B参数的MoE架构，支持1M上下文长度。针对国产芯片显存带宽受限问题，讯飞研发了长程任务动态并行训练技术及基于国产异构算力的分布式推理技术，解决了训练效率与带宽瓶颈。同步开源的星火 X2.6-4B端侧模型在智能体能力上实现阶跃，推理效率优于Ollama。在定价方面，X2.6推理限时定价为输入每百万tokens 0.9元、缓存命中0.08元、输出3.6元，X2.6-4B端侧模型推理限时免费。目前，X2.6系列已在讯飞星火官网开放试用，并首发端云一体协同架构，支持按任务场景自定义安全策略。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 向所有客户开放 Decisions API，决策延迟最低降至100毫秒级</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62eaa11015e5765ca0d7b6cf73e106e2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 向所有客户开放 Decisions API，决策延迟最低降至100毫秒级AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Oct 23, 20263OpenAI 于10月22日正式向所有客户开放 Decisions API，推出面向快速决策场景的 API 服务，直接参与由初创公司 TypeSafe 的 Jev 模型带动的决策模型竞争。OpenAI 于9月29日开发者日宣布该产品，核心是重新配置 ChatGPT Luna 模型，以降低推理延迟和使用成本，而非专门训练独立决策模型。据 OpenAI API 产品负责人 Nikunj Handa 介绍，Decisions API 可将处理时间从1—3秒缩短至100—180毫秒。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
